OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather   
OL,6,Fcloudy, with outbreaks of rain across  
OL,7,Fthe west. Cloudy, with outbreaks of    
OL,8,Frain on Saturday, especially in the    
OL,9,Fafternoon. Becoming dry by Sunday,     
OL,10,Fwith sunshine. Temperatures recovering 
OL,11,Fto normal.                             
